//! Chunk Quality & Anti-Heresy Audit (Organic RAG Falsification Gate)
//!
//! Enforces:
//! 1. Zero giant chunks (> 8,000 characters) across the entire corpus.
//! 2. P99 of chunk line count <= 75 lines.
